Third-party material: none is vendored in this repository. The compiler is a
plain Python package with no third-party runtime dependencies; the optional
`tokens` extra installs `tiktoken` and the optional `hf` extra installs
`transformers`, both under their own licenses and neither required by the
compiler. Generated C programs call only the C standard library.

